      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think we need to split this into two functions. The one with that takes a `renderer` is also misleading because it skips over the path effect handling (not currently an issue because the `drawBlur` checks for a path effect and returns false).\n\nSince we have the new Geometry type, that can just be included in the type checks at the start of `chooseRenderer`.",
